//// set: rp-p1 — 结构求值里的记录字段参数（if 条件 / 维 / for 范围 / 绑定里引用 `r.a`、嵌套记录、Evaluate = false）
//// model: P10
record R
parameter Real a = 1;
end R;
model P10
parameter R r;
Real y;
equation
if r.a <= 0 then
y = 0;
else
y = time;
end if;
end P10;
//// model: P11
record R
parameter Real a = 1;
end R;
model P11
parameter R r(a = -1);
Real y;
equation
if r.a <= 0 then
y = 0;
else
y = time;
end if;
end P11;
//// model: P12
record R
parameter Real a = 1;
end R;
model P12
parameter R r0(a = 2);
parameter R r = r0;
Real y;
equation
if r.a <= 0 then
y = 0;
else
y = time;
end if;
end P12;
//// model: P13
record R
parameter Real a = 1;
end R;
model F
parameter R r;
Real y;
equation
if r.a <= 0 then
y = 0;
else
y = time;
end if;
end F;
model P13
parameter R q(a = -3);
F f(r = q);
end P13;
//// model: P14
record R
parameter Real a = 1;
parameter Real b = 2 * a;
end R;
model P14
parameter R r(a = 0.25);
Real y;
equation
if r.b > 1 then
y = 0;
else
y = time;
end if;
end P14;
//// model: P15
record R
parameter Integer n = 2;
end R;
model P15
parameter R r;
Real v[r.n];
equation
v = fill(time, r.n);
end P15;
//// model: P16
record R
parameter Integer n = 2;
end R;
model P16
parameter R r(n = 3);
Real y;
equation
y = sum(i * time for i in 1:r.n);
end P16;
//// model: P17
record R
parameter Real a = 1;
end R;
model P17
parameter R r;
Real y;
equation
y = if r.a > 0 then time else 0;
end P17;
//// model: P18
record R
parameter Real a = 1;
end R;
model P18
R r;
Real y;
equation
if r.a <= 0 then
y = 0;
else
y = time;
end if;
end P18;
//// model: P19
record R
constant Real a = 1;
end R;
model P19
parameter R r;
Real y;
equation
if r.a <= 0 then
y = 0;
else
y = time;
end if;
end P19;
//// model: P110
record R
parameter Real a = 1;
end R;
model P110
parameter R r annotation(Evaluate = false);
Real y;
equation
if r.a <= 0 then
y = 0;
else
y = time;
end if;
end P110;
//// model: P111
record R
parameter Real a = 1;
end R;
record D
R f;
end D;
model P111
parameter D d;
Real y;
equation
if d.f.a <= 0 then
y = 0;
else
y = time;
end if;
end P111;
